    "title": "LMPD investigating a man shot in arm on Poplar Level Road - NewsBreak",
    "text": "36 minutes ago LOUISVILLE, Ky. — At around 10:26 p.m. Tuesday, the Louisville Metro Police Department responded to a report of a shooting in the 5000 block of Poplar Level Road. Officers found an adult male who had been shot in the arm. Police said he was conscious and alert when transported to Jewish Hospital with injuries not considered life-threatening. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
